]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/events/blackfriday/8?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=bPA0U&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_p=f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_r=R1SX5K2X9AVQNJ5CW6DM&amp;pd_rd_wg=fBOUb&amp;pd_rd_r=fe5aac55-a082-4032-a7e5-9884dc0333d4&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;promotionsSearchLastSeenAsin=B0DJ1D4SHM&amp;promotionsSearchStartIndex=90&amp;promotionsSearchPageSize=90&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=6f493fe221b4d694802b10f3c24d1330&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115377 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg" alt="" width="1036" height="881" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026.jpg 1036w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-300x255.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-1024x871.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Updated-List-November-25-2026-768x653.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> started their LEGO Black Friday 2026 deals earlier last week. They have now upgraded some of the discount percentages as well as added a few more new sets. There are <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/events/blackfriday/8?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=bPA0U&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_p=f543cd77-a484-40c6-a680-51de9519c6da&amp;pf_rd_r=R1SX5K2X9AVQNJ5CW6DM&amp;pd_rd_wg=fBOUb&amp;pd_rd_r=fe5aac55-a082-4032-a7e5-9884dc0333d4&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;promotionsSearchLastSeenAsin=B0DJ1D4SHM&amp;promotionsSearchStartIndex=90&amp;promotionsSearchPageSize=90&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=6f493fe221b4d694802b10f3c24d1330&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 200 LEGO sets discounted for Black Friday 2026 at Amazon Canada</a>.</p>
<p>For example, <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Potter-Diagon-Wizarding-Building/dp/B0DHLHLX1B?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=1a5d708d3d9451b05cbe191f14c48189&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Harry Potter Diagon Alley Wizarding Shops 76444</a> has now been further reduced to <strong>$184.99</strong> (reg.$259.99). Savings now work out to be 29% off.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92969 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="970" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 970w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x264.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x677.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92971 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="988" height="874" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 988w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x265.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x679.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 988px) 100vw, 988px" /></p>
<p>Be sure to check out the Amazon Black Friday Week 2026 <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/blackfriday?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=4cba3bdbf7e130e22b845b636870c50f&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a>. There are deals in every department (not just LEGO). Prime Membership is <span style="text-decoration: underline;">not required</span> to purchase these sets with Black Friday savings. Free shipping on orders above $35 CAD.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-64402 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="545" height="230" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner.jpg 927w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner-300x127.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Amazon-Logo-Banner-768x324.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 545px) 100vw, 545px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>For Amazon LEGO Bestsellers List, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="679" height="542" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 679px) 100vw, 679px" /></p>
