		<title>Time is Running Out to Enter Our Two LEGO Holiday Christmas Building Contests 2026: Win Awesome FREE LEGO Prizes!</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/time-is-running-out-to-enter-our-two-lego-holiday-christmas-building-contests-2026-win-awesome-free-lego-prizes/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/time-is-running-out-to-enter-our-two-lego-holiday-christmas-building-contests-2026-win-awesome-free-lego-prizes/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:25:41 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Contests]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
