					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1475" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO IDEAS 21345 Polaroid OneStep SX-70 Camera January 2024 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1475w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x244.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x833.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x625.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1475px) 100vw, 1475px" /></p>
<p>Happy Late Wednesday Afternoon Everyone! Amazon US currently has some pretty deals for today. Free shipping on orders</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-handpicked-verified-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-late-afternoon-november-25-2026/">8 Handpicked &#038; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Late Afternoon, November 25, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Late Wednesday Afternoon Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some pretty deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, Amazon prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-87357 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1076" height="875" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1475w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x244.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x833.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x625.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1076px) 100vw, 1076px" /></p>
<p>This one, <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Polaroid-Building-Collectible-Brick-Built/dp/B0CGY4H58V?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=9feb7c99e8a220e1e5763639be348837&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Ideas Polaroid OneStep SX-70 21345</a> at 44% off for <strong>$44.99</strong> (reg.$79.99) is pretty good. <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-City-Trains-60506/dp/B0G2T3YJ43?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=98dec7cee8ba63ce4c7a4f84a1a3fd17&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Classic Beach Streetcar 60506</a> is a really nice set and has now been further reduced to <strong>$59.99</strong> (reg.$74.99). Savings work out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-109486 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Lifestyle-5.jpg" alt="" width="1080" height="720" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Lifestyle-5.jpg 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Lifestyle-5-1536x1024.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px" /></p>
<p>Below are 8 of our Handpicked &amp; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Late Afternoon, November 25, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email list so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<h3>8 Handpicked &amp; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Late Afternoon, November 25, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>38% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Star-Wars-75446/dp/B0FMYVKFVT?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=6bfe7348a91cfa8fbedc8e26b852c43b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars Grogu (Mandalorian Apprentice) 75446</a> <strong>$80.99</strong> (reg.$129.99)</li>
<li>35% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Wars-Mandalorian-Building/dp/B0DHLH39JV?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=ee02cf3107f7f3a00f63563ac4e6160a&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars The Mandalorian: Grogu with Hover Pram 75403</a> <strong>$64.99</strong> (reg.$99.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92950 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75403-Grogu-with-Hover-Pram-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="618" height="900" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75403-Grogu-with-Hover-Pram-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 618w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75403-Grogu-with-Hover-Pram-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-206x300.jpg 206w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 618px) 100vw, 618px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-105081 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75446-Grogu-Mandalorian-Apprentice-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="865" height="854" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75446-Grogu-Mandalorian-Apprentice-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 865w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75446-Grogu-Mandalorian-Apprentice-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75446-Grogu-Mandalorian-Apprentice-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x758.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 865px) 100vw, 865px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-105082 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75446-Grogu-Mandalorian-Apprentice-April-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="588" height="864" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75446-Grogu-Mandalorian-Apprentice-April-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 588w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75446-Grogu-Mandalorian-Apprentice-April-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-204x300.jpg 204w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 588px) 100vw, 588px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>44% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Polaroid-Building-Collectible-Brick-Built/dp/B0CGY4H58V?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=9feb7c99e8a220e1e5763639be348837&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Ideas Polaroid OneStep SX-70 21345</a> <strong>$44.99</strong> (reg.$79.99)</li>
<li>30% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Plates-60304-Building-Pieces/dp/B08HVYJFVC?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=2cd3844ef72f3bab09674584c8f33ca3&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Road Plates 60304</a> <strong>$13.99</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-59418 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/LEGO-60304-City-Road-Plates-2021.jpg" alt="" width="1022" height="921" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/LEGO-60304-City-Road-Plates-2021.jpg 1022w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/LEGO-60304-City-Road-Plates-2021-300x270.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/LEGO-60304-City-Road-Plates-2021-768x692.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1022px) 100vw, 1022px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-87357 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="962" height="783" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1475w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x244.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x833.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x625.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 962px) 100vw, 962px" /></p>
