<p>Three LEGO Friends January 2027 sets were revealed earlier last month. Now, another new LEGO Friends January 2027</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-friends-42717-family-dollhouse-january-2027-set-revealed-release-dates-us-canada-prices-images/">LEGO Friends 42717 Family Dollhouse January 2027 Set Revealed: Release Dates, US/Canada Prices &#038; Images</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
