					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1967" height="1943" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Two-LEGO-Fortnite-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-77084-P-1000-77088-Guacos-Tacos-Front-Back-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Two LEGO Fortnite January 2027 Sets Revealed (77084 P-1000 &amp; 77088 Guaco&#039;s Tacos) Front &amp; Back Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Two-LEGO-Fortnite-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-77084-P-1000-77088-Guacos-Tacos-Front-Back-Box.jpg 1967w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Two-LEGO-Fortnite-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-77084-P-1000-77088-Guacos-Tacos-Front-Back-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Two-LEGO-Fortnite-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-77084-P-1000-77088-Guacos-Tacos-Front-Back-Box-1024x1012.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Two-LEGO-Fortnite-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-77084-P-1000-77088-Guacos-Tacos-Front-Back-Box-768x759.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Two-LEGO-Fortnite-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-77084-P-1000-77088-Guacos-Tacos-Front-Back-Box-1536x1517.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1967px) 100vw, 1967px" /></p>
