		<item>
		<title>LEGOLAND California, Florida &#038; New York Black Friday 2026 Deals Ending Soon: Save Up to 50-60% off on Theme Park Tickets, Annual Passes &#038; Hotels</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-california-florida-new-york-black-friday-2026-deals-ending-soon-save-up-to-50-60-off-on-theme-park-tickets-annual-passes-hotels/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-california-florida-new-york-black-friday-2026-deals-ending-soon-save-up-to-50-60-off-on-theme-park-tickets-annual-passes-hotels/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:01:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO & LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
