		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115306</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="887" height="885" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND California Theme Park Resort Black Friday Up to 50% off Tickets, Hotel Stays and Annual Passes Banner Logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg 887w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-768x766.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px" /></p>
<p>As a friendly reminder, the LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (California &#124; Florida &#124; New York) are still having</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-california-florida-new-york-black-friday-2026-deals-ending-soon-save-up-to-50-60-off-on-theme-park-tickets-annual-passes-hotels/">LEGOLAND California, Florida &#038; New York Black Friday 2026 Deals Ending Soon: Save Up to 50-60% off on Theme Park Tickets, Annual Passes &#038; Hotels</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102219 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-700x339-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="700" height="339" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-700x339-Banner-Logo.jpg 700w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-700x339-Banner-Logo-300x145.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></p>
<p>As a friendly reminder, the LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a>) are still having their Black Friday 2026 specials. Though, time is running out as some of these sales will end soon. For California and Florida, the Black Friday deals will end on Sunday, November 29, 2026. For the New York resort, the Black Friday deals end on December 2, 2026.</p>
<p>This is the best time of the year to secure your park tickets, get your annual passes or book hotel packages at LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a>).</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114977 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="517" height="516" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg 887w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-768x766.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 517px) 100vw, 517px" /></p>
