					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="2560" height="1194" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Back-Box-76481-76482-76487-40992-scaled.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Harry Potter January 2027 Release Date Front &amp; Back Box (76481 76482 76487 40992)" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Back-Box-76481-76482-76487-40992-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Back-Box-76481-76482-76487-40992-300x140.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Back-Box-76481-76482-76487-40992-1024x478.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Back-Box-76481-76482-76487-40992-768x358.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Back-Box-76481-76482-76487-40992-1536x716.jpg 1536w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Back-Box-76481-76482-76487-40992-2048x955.jpg 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" /></p>
<p>Four all-new LEGO Harry Potter January 2027 sets have been revealed LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). We&#8217;ll look at the release</p>
