]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Four all-new LEGO Harry Potter January 2027 sets have been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). We&#8217;ll look at the release dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more in this article! Two of the sets are now available for pre-order while the other two you will have to wait until the new year.</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when these January 2027 LEGO Harry Potter sets become available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-115280 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76487-Hogwarts-Express-Platform-9¾-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76487-Hogwarts-Express-Platform-9¾-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76487-Hogwarts-Express-Platform-9¾-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76487-Hogwarts-Express-Platform-9¾-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76487-Hogwarts-Express-Platform-9¾-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>76481 Privet Drive (Pre-Orders Now Accepted)</li>
<li>76482 Gryffindor Common Room (Pre-Orders Now Accepted)</li>
<li>76487 Hogwarts Express &amp; Platform 9¾</li>
<li>40992 BrickHeadz Harry, Draco and Hagrid Figures</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<h2><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO 67023 Marvel Rivals: Jeff the Land Shark January 2027 Set Revealed: Release Dates, US/Canada Prices &amp; Set Images</span></h2>
<h3>76481 Privet Drive January 2027</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: $59.99 USD / $79.99 CAD / £54.99 GBP / $89.99 AUD</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 8+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 545</li>
<li>Official Release Date: January 1, 2027 (Pre-Orders Now Accepted)</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
