grid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Product-Image-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Product-Image-768x432.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-115265 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Product-Image-2.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="675" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Product-Image-2.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Product-Image-2-300x169.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Product-Image-2-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Product-Image-2-768x432.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-115266 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Measurement-Dimensions-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-115267 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle.webp" alt="" width="800" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle.webp 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-200x300.webp 200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-683x1024.webp 683w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x1152.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-115268 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Harry-Potter-40992-BrickHeadz-Harry-Draco-and-Hagrid-Figures-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2