			</item>
		<item>
		<title>[US] LEGO Black Friday 2026 Deals List Summary Update for Kohl&#8217;s, Amazon, Wal-Mart &#038; Target</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-lego-black-friday-2026-deals-list-summary-update-for-kohls-amazon-wal-mart-target/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-lego-black-friday-2026-deals-list-summary-update-for-kohls-amazon-wal-mart-target/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:29:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks Sales]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115250</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="979" height="836" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Black Friday 2026 LEGO Wal-Mart US Deals &amp; Sales List November 25, 2026 Update" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg 979w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-300x256.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-768x656.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 979px) 100vw, 979px" /></p>
<p>Black Friday LEGO Deals 2026 are still available at various major retailers including at Kohl’s US, Amazon US, Walmart</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-lego-black-friday-2026-deals-list-summary-update-for-kohls-amazon-wal-mart-target/">[US] LEGO Black Friday 2026 Deals List Summary Update for Kohl&#8217;s, Amazon, Wal-Mart &#038; Target</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Black Friday LEGO Deals 2026 are still available at various major retailers including at <a href="https://howl.link/nig6x6lzl0x3u" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kohl’s US</a>, <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a>, <a href="https://howl.link/8iblat2mcr0yo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Walmart US</a> and <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a>. We reported on the deals earlier a few days ago and here&#8217;s a quick update as to what&#8217;s still available.</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget to visit our website regularly and subscribe to our email list so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO deals that are in the United States!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p><em>Shown below are some of the Black Friday 2026 LEGO Deals at <a href="https://howl.link/nig6x6lzl0x3u" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kohl’s US</a>.</em></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/wv0immpurl0i1" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115255 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg" alt="" width="936" height="833" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg 936w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List-November-25-2026-Update-300x267.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List-November-25-2026-Update-768x683.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 936px) 100vw, 936px" /></a></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Kohl&#8217;s United States</span></h3>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/nig6x6lzl0x3u" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kohl’s US</a> LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 are still available. You can save up to 40% off on selected LEGO building sets. Though, a lot of them are only discounted slightly. There are <a href="https://howl.link/wv0immpurl0i1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">still over 180 LEGO sets to choose from</a>. My pick would probably be the <a href="https://howl.link/lxw1wu6paic46" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Disney&#8217;s Lilo &amp; Stitch 43249</a> for <strong>$38.99</strong> (reg.$64.99) which works out to be 40% off.</p>
<p>In addition, you can also earn $15 Kohl&#8217;s Cash for every $50 spent too! Free shipping with $25 purchase.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/lxw1wu6paic46" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-87581 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Disney-43249-Stitch-March-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="770" height="866" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Disney-43249-Stitch-March-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 770w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Disney-43249-Stitch-March-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-267x300.jpg 267w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Disney-43249-Stitch-March-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x864.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px" /></a></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Amazon United States</span></h3>
<p><a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> still has a lot of their Black Friday 2026 LEGO deals available. Savings varies but most of them are around 30% off or higher. Check out the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday/9?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=liXJg&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.1bcb546b-5c9b-4d77-be7a-276d3ed92fe9&amp;pf_rd_p=1bcb546b-5c9b-4d77-be7a-276d3ed92fe9&amp;pf_rd_r=RWDSB3FM6V5PY24WG1XW&amp;pd_rd_wg=SHe5E&amp;pd_rd_r=f3aa8c6e-c97a-4979-b5c3-9047b999fcb9&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=eee195d03623dc6aebb8bea7113f0ac8&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">full list over here</a>. Free shipping on orders above $35 at Amazon and Prime Membership is not required to take advantage of the deals.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday/9?_encoding=UTF8&amp;pd_rd_w=liXJg&amp;content-id=amzn1.sym.1bcb546b-5c9b-4d77-be7a-276d3ed92fe9&amp;pf_rd_p=1bcb546b-5c9b-4d77-be7a-276d3ed92fe9&amp;pf_rd_r=RWDSB3FM6V5PY24WG1XW&amp;pd_rd_wg=SHe5E&amp;pd_rd_r=f3aa8c6e-c97a-4979-b5c3-9047b999fcb9&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=eee195d03623dc6aebb8bea7113f0ac8&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115254 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-25-2026-Update-List.jpg" alt="" width="1038" height="873" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-25-2026-Update-List.jpg 1038w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-25-2026-Update-List-300x252.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-25-2026-Update-List-1024x861.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-25-2026-Update-List-768x646.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1038px) 100vw, 1038px" /></a></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Wal-Mart United States</span></h3>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/8iblat2mcr0yo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Walmart US Online</a> Black Friday 2026 deals run from November 23-29, 2026 or while supplies last. There are <a href="https://howl.link/dzcgb9pugmx5i" target="_blank" rel="noopener">still a couple of sets</a> which are heavily discounted  by 50% off. Check out the image of the deals below.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/dzcgb9pugmx5i" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115251 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg" alt="" width="979" height="836" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg 979w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-300x256.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black-Friday-2026-LEGO-Wal-Mart-US-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-768x656.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 979px) 100vw, 979px" /></a></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Target United States</span></h3>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US Online</a> also still has a good selection of LEGO sets discounted for Black Friday 2026 with savings up to 40% off. There are <a href="https://howl.link/s4h340w75z1c4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 200 sets discounted</a>. Note that some of the regular prices are lower at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> compared to <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/s4h340w75z1c4" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115252 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg" alt="" width="908" height="910" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update.jpg 908w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-768x770.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 908px) 100vw, 908px" /></a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>It would not be a bad idea to <a href="https://howl.link/4ezgaop3e3own" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pick up some of the Target US exclusives that are on sale</a>. These ones are available only for purchase at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> and <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>. Other retailers do not sell them.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/4ezgaop3e3own" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-115253 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-Target-Exclusive.jpg" alt="" width="959" height="585" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-Target-Exclusive.jpg 1174w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-Target-Exclusive-300x183.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-Target-Exclusive-1024x625.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-Sales-List-November-25-2026-Update-Target-Exclusive-768x468.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 959px) 100vw, 959px" /></a></p>
<p>The <a href="https://howl.link/pbz08lpgvheip" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Creator 3 in 1 Medieval Horse Knight Castle 31168</a> at <strong>$103.99</strong> (reg.$129.99) is not a bad buy either. Its a nice set and its available at 20% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/pbz08lpgvheip" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96532 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="879" height="835" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 879w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x285.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x730.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 879px) 100vw, 879px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/pbz08lpgvheip" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96533 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="932" height="820" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 932w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x264.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31168-Medieval-Horse-Knight-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x676.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 932px) 100vw, 932px" /></a></p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35 at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>.<strong> If you have a Target Circle Card, you&#8217;ll save an extra 5% off as well (on top of discounted prices).</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-40079 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="759" height="215" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner.jpg 1148w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner-300x84.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner-1024x289.jpg 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 759px) 100vw, 759px" /></a></p>
